Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 16:43:44 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: t8015: enable the D221 PCIe and power the
 Wi-Fi endpoint

Enable the controller and dart-apcie3 on the d221 board, and give the
endpoint its power rail: a fixed regulator on the SMC PMU GPIO 14
("gP0e", active-high) plus a pci-pwrctrl node the h9p driver powers before
it brings the port up. The endpoint claims the BCM4357's PCI ID,
pci14e4,440a.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
